# Local design-intelligence tooling (ui-ux-pro-max skill installed via
# `uipro init --ai claude` for design system queries). Skill artefacts
# are local tooling, not portal source — don't ship them.
#
# Exception: the impeccable design skill is vendored deliberately (Apache-2.0,
# tranche 162 / masterprompt 2026-08-17 §3.4) so every session shares one
# pinned version. Contents are excluded with /* rather than the directory
# itself, because git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is
# excluded.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/impeccable/
#
# Exception: the apple-design skill (Apple HIG design rules, generalised for
# cross-platform UI) is vendored on the same terms, so portal design reviews
# run against one pinned copy instead of a per-machine install. Upstream
# states no licence; see gt-factory-os-production-brain/.claude/skills/VENDORED.md
# for the provenance ledger covering both copies.
!.claude/skills/apple-design/
design-system/
